today we're talking about subsea cable  startup sustainability and monitoring  your vms i'm carter morgan and welcome  to this week in cloud where we serve you  the lowest latency news  we're excited to announce apricot a new  subsea cable that will connect singapore  japan guam the philippines taiwan and  indonesia it's expected to be ready for  service in 2024  in total we have investments in 18  subsea cables alongside our 27 cloud  regions and 82 zones around the world  check out the blog for more about the  sub seat cables and connectivity  our first ever google cloud startup  summit will be taking place on september  9 2021  google cloud is committed to maximizing  your potential and we know how critical  mentoring and support can be on a  startup journey we hope you will join us  as we bring together our startup  community including startup founders  ctos vcs and google experts to provide  behind-the-scenes insights and inspiring  stories of innovation check out the blog  for a look at the agenda and register  today  a recent google commission study  illustrated the importance of  sustainability for organizations i.t  departments while also revealing that  significant work is needed before  businesses meet their sustainability  goals the good news is that 90 say that  sustainability is a priority for their  i.t departments and as more  organizations consider the benefits of  digital transformation and cloud  migration sustainability is a must-have  or major consideration when evaluating  cloud providers check out the blog to  learn about the obstacles and pathways  to progress and how google cloud can be  supportive  we're happy to announce the general  availability of an enhanced in-context  set of ui-based tools for compute engine  users to help make the troubleshooting  journey easier and more intuitive from  the google console developers can click  into any vm and access a rich set of  pre-built visualizations designed to  give insights into common scenarios and  issues associated with cpu disk memory  networking and live processes  with access to all of this data in one  location you can easily correlate  between signals over a given time frame  check out the blog for more  if you want to read more about these  announcements or see the full list check  out the link and if you have any  thoughts or ideas leave us a comment or  tweet us and we'll see you in the cloud
 

